		<div class="row mb-5 justify-content-between">
			<div class="col-lg-6 text-black-100 order-lg-2">
				<p>
					"Is It Rolling, Bob? Talking Dylan" was a private project by Kerry Shale and Lucas Hare. The podcast, hosted by the two actors, typically released new episodes every four weeks.<br />
					After running for five years and producing 80 episodes, the podcast came to an end in June 2022. Since the project was created by Kerry Shale and Lucas Hare, they retain the copyright.<br />
					On October 20, 2024, Lucas Hare and Kerry Shale permanently shut down their social media profiles.
				</p>
				<p>
					Famous Quote: "Actors Kerry Shale and Lucas Hare talk to interesting people about Bob Dylan. And lots of other things."
				</p>
				<p>
